  <para style="h">Thayithasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo gwaPhawuli ekwalila THAYITHASI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thayithasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Thayi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo gwaPhawuli ekwalila</para>
  <para style="mt1">THAYITHASI</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo gwaThayithasi gumwe gwewhalo dzilinna dzakakwagwa naPhawuli ekwalila nhu esingakwalile gubungano lebagalimoyo. Dzimwe dzili nhatu ndi 1 Thimothi na Thimothi naFilimoni. Phawuli waka ekwalila Thayithasi koga wakakwala kunga kunoyi lukwalo igogu gungabaligwa bamwe banhu. Tokuziba ikoku nentha yekuti wakaleba patjena zwinowunthama akalizanila tjigalo tjebupositoli, tjinhu Thayithasi tjaakafanila kuti wakagala etjiziba. Kokumbuligwa kuti Phawuli wakakwala lukwalo igogu mumakole angaba makumi matanhatu ana makole matatu kunoti kumakumi matanhatu ana makole mahanu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuli waka alaya Thayithasi kuti atungamile makubungano abagalimoyo aka eli mutjigwizi tjekuKhiriti. Phawuli wakakwala lukwalo igogu elaya Thayithasi zila yehala batungamili bemakubungano nebadiya zila yetungamila. Phawuli wakakwalila Thimothi milayo iyo zwayo paakakwala whalo dzaka dziyenda kuna Thayithasi. Lukwalo gugwe golongolosa kuti batungamili bemakubungano bakafanila kuti basumikile nezila inothama kuti balemekedzewe kwazo. Makubungano ebagalimoyo nebatungamili bawo mumahhuba anasi bakafanila lingisisa kwazo mamo anohakika kuna ibabo bamubutungamili.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwakamumiwa mukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unolaya Thayithasi kuti ahale batungamili banohla Ndzimu (Thayithasi 1.1-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unolaya Thayithasi kuti adiye banhu kuti batjile bupenyu gunahla Ndzimu (Thayithasi 2.1––3.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unofidza nebuyisa nange budza Thayithasi ndongoloso dzidze (Thayithasi 3.12-15)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Kubva kunaPhawuli, nlanda weNdzimu ali mpositoli waYesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:1">Ndakatumwa kuti ndibhatshe bugalimoyo gwebahalugwa beNdzimu kakale ndipamidzile luzibo gwabo gwemalebeswa mukuhla Ndzimu, <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />mukugalabgwe mubutjilo gusingapele, gwatakagadziwabgwe neNdzimu asanhu akabumba hango, iye usingatongoleba manyepwa. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Ngwenu nelubaka gwakafanila ikoku kwakazwilayidza mudama lile ngesumikila iko kwandakawamutjidziwa ngelaya kweNdzimu Ntjidzi wedu.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Kuna Thayithasi, nkololo wangu wemalebeswa mubugalimoyo gwatinago tose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Ngoni nekunyalala kunobva kuNdzimu ibo Tate naKhirisitu Yesu Ntjidzi wedu ngakube kukuli.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">N'hingo waThayithasi kuKhirethe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Ndizo ndakakusiya kuKhirethe kuti upedzise zwakazwasalila kuti zwiyetiwe, uhale whola mumizi mikulu yose sekwandakakulaya. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Unohagwa kuti abewhola unofanila ba asina nlandu, ali nlume unamfumakadzi un'ompela, unabana banozibgwa kuti bagalimoyo, basingazibgwe nehaya mazwibhato kene sawhilila. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Ngobe nlisi wegubungano, senhu wakabhata n'hingo weNdzimu, wakafanila ba nhu usina nlandu, azofanila ba nhu unozwibudza kene unamoyo ntikinini, kene unolaladza, kene nhu unabuhongola, kene unoda mari, <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />koga wakafanila ba nhu unowamutjila bezi, unoda tjibuya, unozwidziba, wakatambunuka, wakayengemala, kakale unamazwibhato. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Wakafanila bhatilila mudama linogalikabgwe sediyiwa kwalo, kuyetila kuti akuludzile bamwe nediya kwelebeswa, kakale etubule tambunudza ibabo banonyanyayidzana nediya kwelebeswa.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Ngobe kuna banhu banjinji kwazo kwazo ibabo bebunga lebakathumbigwa banopanduka betjebela banhu beleba zwilebo zwebulengwe. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Bakafanila tjemegwa, kuti banyalale zwilebo zwabo ngobe banosilinga miha yose, ngediya zwabasakafanila diya beyetila wana mari koga. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Umwe wabo alinlebesimbeli wabo kakale wakati, “Banhu bekuKhirethe bagala banyepi, zwibanda zwibi, zwidli zwihhele busimbe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Banhu bekuKhiriti bagala banyepi zwibanda zwibi, zwidli zwihhele busimbe.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikoku kwakalebgwa na Ephimenidesi</char></note> <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Busupi igogu gulebeswa. Ndizo ke ubatjemele zwakasima, kuyetila kuti bame pabugalimoyo gwakwako, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />pana kuti bawhilile ngano dzetjiJuta kene milayo yebanhu banolamba lebeswa. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kubanhu bakatjena, zose zwinhu zwakatjena, koga kubanhu banahambgwa kakale basingagalemoyo akuna tjakatjena, hana dzabo nemikumbulo yabo kunahambgwa. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Banoti banoziba Ndzimu, koga ngezwiyeto zwabo banowunlandula, banobengwa nabose, abatowhilila, abazolulamila kene upi zwawo n'hingo mbuya.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Zwidiyo Zwemalebeswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Koga iwe, diya zwinhu zwinoyendidzana nezwidiyo zwemalebeswa. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Diya banhu betjilume bawhola kuti babe banhu bahhele mazwibhato, banamamo olemekedzewa, bana bulubi gwakwako, bana bugalimoyo gwakasima, bana ludo kwazo, banosimidzila. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Nezila iyo zwayo laya banhu betjikadzi bawhola kuti batjile nezila inolemekedzeka muthama kwabo, basibebanhu banoyeta bun'wa, kene balanda bewayini, ngabadiye kwakanaka koga, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />kuyetila kuti badiye bafumakadzi batjetjana kuti babe neludo kubalume babo nebana babo, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />babe nebulubi gwakwako, babe babuyanana, betjengeta miha yabo zwibuyanana, babe nebunhu, kakale bazwitebamise kubalume babo, kuyetila kuti dama leNdzimu lisilebgwe kwakayipa.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Nezila iyo zwayo kuludzila bahhuhha kuti bazwibhate. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Muzwinhu zose iwe ube tjilakidzilo ngeyeta mihingo mibuya. Mudiya kuko lakidza moyo wemalebeswa, nezila inolemekedzeka. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Uhingise matama akatambunuka asingake akanyanyayidziwa, kuyetila kuti zwita zwizo zwibhakhwe nehoni, zwihaye tjakayipa tjazwingaleba nekwedu.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Udiye balanda kuti bazwise pasi kwabobatezi babo, babahanhise muzwinhu zose, basihandudzane nabo, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />kakale basibakwibile, koga balakidze kuti bakalulama banogalikabgwe, kuyetila kuti balayidze nezila dzose naka kwezwidiyo zweNdzimu iye Ntjidzi wedu.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Ngobe ngoni dzeNdzimu dzakazumbunugwa kudze tjidziwa kuswikile banhu bose, <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />ngoni idzedzo dzotidiya kuti tisiyane nesanamata, nenjemulo dzehango iyeyi, titjile bupenyu gwakalulama, gwakatambunuka, tibe nebutjilo guna hla Ndzimu muna ino hango, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />takamilila kugalabgwe kwakakombolegwa, boneka kwegudzo leNdzimu wedu iye nkulu neNtjidzi Yesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />wakazwipila kuyetila iswi kuti atiwangule kubva mububi gose, kuti azwitjenesele banhu babe banahuha yethama zwiyeto zwibuya.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Diya zwinhu izwezwi, kuludzila, kakale utjemele nemasimba ose. Kusitongoba nenhu unokulingila pasi.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Mazwibhato eBaKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Ukumbudze banhu ibabo kuti bazwitebamise pasi kwebatongi nebanamasimba babawhilile, bagale bakazwilulamisila thama kene upi zwawo n'hingo mbuya. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Basilebe zwakayipa nekwewumwe nhu, basiyane nekakabadzana, babe nemoyo wakatebama, bazwitebamise kunhu wose. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Ngobe iswi tjekwedu takaba tili zwilengwe, tisingawhilile, takalahika, tilibalanda benjemulo mbi dzakasiyana siyana, tida zipigwa, mahhuba ose tithama bubi nendandala, banhu betibenga, naswibo tibengana, <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />koga pakwakabonekwa ngoni dzeNdzimu iye Ntjidzi wedu neda banhu kukwe, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />wakatitjidza esingakuthame ngentha yemihingo yedu yatakathama mukululama, koga kubva mumawhilangoni awe, ngesukwa kwezwagwa butshwa nange yetiwa batshwa ngeMeya Yakayengemala, <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />yaakadulula nebunji pehhugwi kwedu ndiYesu Khirisitu Ntjidzi wedu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />kuyetila kuti tilulamisiwe nengoni dzidze, kakale tibe belukata tili mukugalabgwe mubutjilo gusingapele. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Ndebo iyeyi ilebeswa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:8">Ndohaka kuti ukowhomesedze zwinhu izwezwi, kuyetila kuti ibabo bakagalamoyo muNdzimu bazwipile thama mihingo mibuya, ngobe izwezwi zwinhu zwakanaka kakale zobhatsha banhu bose. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Koga tsheduka pabulengwe nekakabadzana, nelondesedzo dzebukamu, neyetilana, negwisana ngekwenlayo kusina n'hingo, ngobe akutobhatsha kakale akuna tjakunopundula. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Nhu unoda thubukanya banhu uwuntjemele kan'ompela kene kabili. Hule kwayipapo hapa esingakuwhilile uthubukane naye, <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />noba weziba kuti nhu wakajalo wakakombama unotjila mumatjinyo, kakale unozwitilika nlandu.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Layiwa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Hapa ndatuma Athemasi kene Thikhikhasi kukuli, ugwise nemasimba awo wose hha kundili kuNikhopholisi, ngobe ndahala kuti mbaba yose ndowhoba ndili ikweno. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Ugwise kwazo ubhatshe Zinasi nzibi wenlayo, naApholosi kuti batange gwendo gwabo, ube nemalebeswa kuti abana tjabanohaya. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Banhu bedu bakafanila diyika hinga mihingo mibuya, kuyetila kuti bazwipile bhatsha muna zwinobe zwihakika, basibe betjila butjilo gusina mitjelo.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Bose bandinabo ngeno banokubuyisa. Ubuyise bose banotida mubugalimoyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Ngoni ngadzibe namwi mose.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>